{"id":"tipografies-i-text","title":"Tipografies i text","topic":"css","topicLabel":"CSS","tags":["aprendizaje","css"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":0.5,"words":59,"backlinks":[{"id":"sesion-08-19-05-26","title":"Sesion_08_19.05.26","topicLabel":"HTML","session":8}],"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Són les propietats que fan que el text es llegeixi bé. Pots canviar el tipus de lletra (<code>font-family</code>), la mida (<code>font-size</code>), el gruix (<code>font-weight</code>), l&#39;alineació (<code>text-align</code>) o l&#39;espai entre línies (<code>line-height</code>) per fer-ho més llegible .</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">css</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">p</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-family</span>: Arial, sans-serif;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">18px</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">line-height</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1.6</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">text-align</span>: justify;\n}</code></pre></div>"}